  "description": "Lightweight extensions methods (and constants) for common programming tasks:\n\nSuffixes (AsMemory, AsTime), Interpolate, Partition, Shuffle (O(n)), Softmax, InnerProduct, IsPrime, ManhattanDistance, EuclideanDistance, InClosedRange, MeanSquaredError, EqualsWithTolerance, HsVtoArgb, Scale, Fit and many more.",
